{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "f35fd6785a1e93637e1bb11ce533bfe0966768cb57513392ae9f61bd0d1a77aa", "ja": "人形達のShout", "zh": "人偶们的Shout", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f0ad8e947b09d9e26145a80fb4d6343e14b6736e9e67e30937271ee6d38661cc", "ja": "もう一人のアイドル達の不満を聞き、人形姿\nのアイドル達は全力で反論する。アイドルに\n対する本気の思いを叫んだ瞬間、屋敷が崩れ\n始める。急いで逃げ出したアイドル達。\n目覚めるとそこは現実世界のバス停だった。", "zh": "听到另一组偶像们的不满后，变成人偶模样\n的偶像们全力反驳。就在她们喊出对偶像\n的真挚心意的瞬间，宅邸开始崩塌。\n偶像们赶紧逃了出去。醒来后，那里已经是\n现实世界的公交车站了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "2ffd5a64798778e2d3c0bc415c8e525e47981d4a33e3d9b73d09afe37217f200", "ja": "……杏奈はもう、疲れたの。\nこれからは……杏奈が踊り続けて。", "zh": "……杏奈已经，累了。\n今后……就由杏奈一直跳下去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "190bdad7d194e18bd50c56716bb21569c52ef6db4376b02d313c1bfeb4847ab4", "ja": "杏奈はもう……アイドルやめるから。", "zh": "杏奈已经……要不当偶像了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "ae6aa61ad5facc5591623eb4e0b790a54e011d1cf903eab2d24ad3c062239aeb", "ja": "どういうこと……？　何言ってるの？\n勝手に決めないで！　杏奈は、アイドルやめないよ！", "zh": "怎么回事……？你在说什么啊？\n不要擅自做决定！杏奈才不会放弃偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "cc4e3a196aab2a1f6465acb12044af390e133bccc70edc28506c27b47f6341b9", "ja": "……勝手にすればいい。\nあなたのためのステージも……ここにある。", "zh": "……随你的便。\n为你准备的舞台……也在这里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "e274a52a5ed337fa95edac22f54f254d093f5e1d162c5dc9e691eed61ee31426", "ja": "ワァァアアアア……！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "e8dabc79c9dfcbfe5bd940d6361d20de4e651d2b295fb3207da27ff840c3ffe1", "ja": "うわぁっ！？\nこの声、どこから聞こえてきてるんだ？", "zh": "哇啊！？\n这声音是从哪里传过来的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "329b86e2f35b47537ee8f3607d32a0e45b0fdfa2a6d9b772cd215cd33542a6f0", "ja": "お客さんはいないのに、歓声だけが聞こえます。\nもしや私たちは、恐怖映画の中にいるのでしょうか。", "zh": "明明没有观众，却只听得见欢呼声。\n难道说，我们现在是在恐怖电影里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "0bb15ad774b17ee2d893ef4af826ade36a5b9166bb5f661948965d61f3007bee", "ja": "クリーピーでスプーキーでウィアードです～！\nイービルスピリットはバニッシュです～！", "zh": "又诡异、又阴森、又奇怪～！\n邪恶的灵魂，消失吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "11ed77bd56ebec8b01091470c4087d8fdfa1ec8a41be5e32d89ed7a612f1828c", "ja": "杏奈は、ここで踊るの。\n杏奈たちの代わりに……永遠に。", "zh": "杏奈会在这里跳舞。代替杏奈她们……直到永远。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "cf747a219a2e41e73c1dc09988786d4578f21fb753ae07f9685d6949fb798467", "ja": "ロコをリスペクトしないワールド、タイアードです～。\nジーニアスはリーブします。バイバイです～♪", "zh": "不尊重ROCO的世界，真是让人疲惫～。\n天才要离开了。拜拜～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "7764960e84fbfcff81ca52c7b215662d6e29d87e3d1d10bc9c74dee692a2b60f", "ja": "ヒラヒラした服着て踊るとか、ガラじゃないよな～。\nアイドルとか、もうやめやめ！", "zh": "穿着飘飘的衣服跳舞什么的，根本不适合我啦～  \n偶像什么的，还是算了算了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "2cb706c8a4bb6d6482d76e9998a7e5aa937628ba4e580c881d7cc4d8595d0415", "ja": "人間には、向き不向きというものがありまして……。\n私がアイドルなんて、最初から無理だったんです。", "zh": "人各有所长，也各有所不擅长……  \n像我这样的人，从一开始就不可能成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "f06aceb9de6fd4a19f60cccd85c1f92d5f401acea85f85c0c224dcdd8dd8ca0a", "ja": "予感に導かれて、アイドルに挑戦してみました。\nですが、ここは私の居場所ではなかったようです。", "zh": "在预感的指引下，我尝试挑战成为偶像。\n但是，看来这里并不是属于我的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "c557dbe229c17880c1b99d5b91f47e15af71ca687b1131d8b2bd89be41225f6e", "ja": "ひ、ひどい！　たしかに私は、運動神経とか、\nアイドル向きじゃないかもしれないけど……！", "zh": "太、太过分了！我的运动神经确实不太好，可能不适合当偶像，但是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "925bc2556c422caae6719c75faac7549b432d338c233a09903ac7417823e95c3", "ja": "そりゃ、ヒラヒラした服は慣れてないけど……。\nでも別に、アイドルやめたいってほどじゃ……。", "zh": "飘飘忽忽的衣服，我确实还不太习惯……  \n但也没到想放弃做偶像的程度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "13873f74e755f3f42c5638ac76f2391a95c748989a1b32271a4bfe79c4c0b0fd", "ja": "……？\nあなたたち、ロコたちじゃありませんね？", "zh": "……？\n你们不是ROCO们吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "ce650a7217e4c856eaaa18b9359dc263c60968d4dd6bfcf3ff2eb9c66355c2fc", "ja": "そうです。みんな、惑わされてはいけません。\nあれは、私たちではありません。", "zh": "没错。大家千万不要被迷惑了。\n那不是我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "1314b36321564b6cd0066ea713c613e3a80e0651c031163bedc53ec90e2eaff8", "ja": "で、でも！　杏奈たち、人形になっちゃったし。\nならあっちが、人間の杏奈が本物なんじゃ……。", "zh": "可、可是！杏奈她们都变成人偶了。  \n那边那个……人类的杏奈才是真的吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "fc3df8bc2e496dfa7315f4b95335027bdf2b5b621934c923be00047a6574b4a0", "ja": "いいえ、フェイクです！　アンナもユリコも、スバルも\nミズキも、アイドルを捨てるなんてありえません！", "zh": "不，是假的！杏奈、百合子、昴，还有瑞希，怎么可能放弃偶像身份呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "d7b83adeaf6e3a08b01fb8da3967f60b4e1ab3c9e80975c8d4e337e8bdb4b1bb", "ja": "ロコはアイドルとして、オーディエンスに\n最高のアートを届けるんです！　絶対にやめませんよ！", "zh": "ROCO要作为偶像，将最棒的艺术呈现给观众！绝对不会停下来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "fd2f8f7e38e23340919ba1cd938ad1da93e08339cc10952838640e8b29035bc9", "ja": "ロコ……。", "zh": "ROCO……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "d776b74edd78e0f506d337a40a984335128ada72fc26bfdc4de5a7be605e1cb3", "ja": "ロコちゃん……。", "zh": "小ROCO……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "38b4263f45e2d967417a06defe84697eba108665f25ec4d6f08d5c855f74556c", "ja": "どうやら彼らは、人の姿形と声を真似ることが\nできるようです。……非現実的な結論ですが。", "zh": "看来它们似乎能够模仿人类的外貌和声音。……虽然这个结论很不现实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "a920344c2591d985c0961a14f4b7caae5b45e58a1e6ee7a16fca25cada5f74c8", "ja": "同じように……人の記憶や不安を、表面的にでも\n読み取ることができるのではないでしょうか。", "zh": "同理……哪怕只是浮于表面，\n它们是不是也能读取人的记忆与不安呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "fbba6a8d26ad16cd89c01206de15da1f5c71fd8e381410ff736333a267d6e381", "ja": "ロコのマインドは、全然リードできてないです。\nロコはリタイアなんて全然考えていないですからね！", "zh": "完全没读懂ROCO的想法。\nROCO根本就没考虑过要隐退呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "b836331438d69a4d5b20c0cc497f99792eaee622b1baa96812f00f596405b80d", "ja": "私もです。私はアイドルになって、毎日楽しいです。\n……ポーカーフェイスでは、伝わりませんか？", "zh": "我也是。我成为偶像后，每天都很开心。……光靠扑克脸，传达不出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "307ad857062d336912c241c405a231952c40533fa2d495970e7fc26575295580", "ja": "そうだよね。あれが私のはずがない……。\n私だって、アイドルやめたいなんて思ってない！", "zh": "对啊。那不可能是我……  \n我也从没想过要放弃偶像身份！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "c904785a9c292fca3e77a2dcf9c3e3534c992bf09ecfdea726439f750224c121", "ja": "オレだって、自分なりにがんばってるんだぜ？\n人の気持ちを、勝手に決めつけんな！", "zh": "我也在按照自己的方式努力啊？\n别擅自替别人决定心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "8a7737d1202f8d63cb4f603233f5a41690b013af5d862f017bcf8d76c7f3db5d", "ja": "ずっと、憧れてた場所なの。\n……やっと、ここまでたどり着いたの！", "zh": "这是我一直憧憬的地方。\n……我终于走到这里了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "eb33d8960a93fe0a06b1681c4823126f6d111057c343ea9c80ff95731c5c1bce", "ja": "あなたなんか、杏奈じゃない！\n杏奈の姿で、杏奈の声でしゃべらないで！", "zh": "你才不是杏奈！\n不要用杏奈的样子、杏奈的声音说话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "53e15e3a34f4b933c0bbc4dbeb9bc0b95b54369edbebc0427e4070b59aafd96a", "ja": "杏奈の動きが止まった……？\n……石になったみたい。他のみんなも……。", "zh": "杏奈的动作停下来了……？\n……好像变成石头了。其他人也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "4ee093986c0d900d9ce9e79141779a228a77c81762282f05e1753c93f5cc76bf", "ja": "あっ……私たち、人間に戻ってる！？\n関節の継ぎ目もないし、本物の皮膚です！", "zh": "啊……我们变回人类了！？  \n关节处也没有接缝，而且是真正的皮肤！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1033_onnnasyujin", "source_sha256": "e024868959badf42fa71b9c2035b204afd652be91ea0825b2856b9e35854af26", "ja": "逃さない……\nおまえ達は、私の人形なのだから……", "zh": "不会让你们逃掉的……\n因为你们都是我的人偶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1034_se", "source_sha256": "97e3801cfb44c4335ade7d0b4cd6db55f070398af698825334e0fda44cc39aca", "ja": "ゴゴゴゴゴ……", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1035_047sub", "source_sha256": "6e2e53a19d207f05d2ca71c2a128e35b7eb52281ee624bc0fcf7718a6bd51fde", "ja": "な、なんだ！？\n屋敷が揺れてるのか、これ！？", "zh": "这、这是怎么回事！？\n是宅邸在摇晃吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "fa606a609242afc17826b52cf888613d5b4b1f2f4078c2683589da4e0b94b66e", "ja": "壁にヒビが……！\n早くここから逃げなきゃ！", "zh": "墙上出现裂缝了……！\n得赶紧逃离这里才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1037_025roc", "source_sha256": "f519168a1f71884e55f4d83e9bdabdba11963d1a4f1931d7bfb7e4d0008e32a1", "ja": "急いでください！\nレジデンスがコラプスします～っ！", "zh": "请快点！\n宅邸要倒塌了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "3d66031422ed8b3d4b73fa5192140b95024c5aeb36745a8426d2bc1475233c85", "ja": "こっちです！\n全員で、脱出しましょう！！", "zh": "这边！\n大家一起逃出去吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1040_basunounntennsyu", "source_sha256": "f1750ddc264e18b12d194cb06411255c9e53dd8bce215ab3b8dc4ef3dc367a8c", "ja": "お客さん！\n……お客さん！", "zh": "客人！\n……客人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1041_044miz", "source_sha256": "04229fd1834026efdc77bdab825e109491e3f5239509588bb8170f1e3274f79f", "ja": "……ん……。ここは……？", "zh": "……嗯……这里是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1042_basunounntennsyu", "source_sha256": "d87c5696777af3172922a3c1c3626871c89a15ab1590879ebab86b2182b078b9", "ja": "大丈夫？　バス停で寝てたでしょ。\nバスが出るから、早く乗って。", "zh": "没事吧？你在公交站睡着了吧。\n公交车要开了，快上来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1043_044miz", "source_sha256": "043909e9aa5aca807c2c683850cc9d3fff921f04c5d46ef1cd3c61d23048f340", "ja": "バス……？", "zh": "公交车……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1044_024ann", "source_sha256": "ad5e70a1ffbc7ebc5880707adbdd196e0b9459bd5f7f22c5c7d1f3f6484208d7", "ja": "…………！\n戻って、これたんだ……！", "zh": "…………！\n回到、现实了吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1045_047sub", "source_sha256": "6ea93abd0820f651b5b3d4ea6209d687f281b287c3ce37e2ba320ce4043f6a76", "ja": "いてて……。\nなんか瓦礫が落ちてきてぶつかったような……。", "zh": "好痛……。\n好像有瓦砾掉下来，撞到我了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "9269ab23688e8613004fffe2f7e6503551febba8feebff046b0212d38456b546", "ja": "さっきまで、必死に走ってた気がするんですけど……\n夢でしょうか？", "zh": "我记得刚才还在拼命奔跑……\n难道是在做梦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1047_025roc", "source_sha256": "220530a9e3bdcfe9e1d39f37e73994b94b56487a714bf3fc6fce990f22c42499", "ja": "それよりみんな、ハリーアップです！\nバスが行っちゃったら、帰れなくなりますよ～！", "zh": "比起那个，大家快点啦！\n要是公交车开走了，我们就回不去了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0429_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0429_story_04_1048_044miz", "source_sha256": "d46258f72a9701dc14f22ea78ce211f9f7b97a260605618d266827a99d57cdbd", "ja": "はい。\n帰りましょう、私達の劇場へ。", "zh": "好的。\n我们回自己的剧场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
